WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:13.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:34.320 --> 00:01:38.920
I left the Argama before they could grill
me about going off on my own.

00:01:39.930 --> 00:01:42.720
Karaba, an anti-Axis group on Earth,

00:01:42.720 --> 00:01:47.300
wants to squeeze Dakar from
the north and south.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:52.370
The Argama can't move out yet, since we
need to coordinate with Karaba.

00:01:52.370 --> 00:01:54.980
The Zeta Gundam and the Double Zeta!

00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:58.900
The Hyaku Shiki,
the Mk. II, and their Mega Rider!

00:01:58.900 --> 00:01:59.820
Iino!

00:01:59.820 --> 00:02:00.980
Mega Rider, go ahead!

00:02:00.980 --> 00:02:02.120
Go!

00:02:02.120 --> 00:02:03.330
Shut up!

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:11.690
The Gundam Team went ahead
to Dakar through the desert!

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:17.500
THE FACE OF ROMMEL

00:02:39.320 --> 00:02:41.900
Commander Rommel!
There's big news!

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.030
Princess Mineva Zabi has entered Dakar!

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:47.550
Zabi? In Dakar?

00:02:47.550 --> 00:02:50.420
Yes. The Earth landing force from Axis...

00:02:50.420 --> 00:02:52.990
has already seized control
of the Federation assembly!

00:02:52.990 --> 00:02:54.260
I see.

00:02:54.260 --> 00:03:00.390
According to intel, AEUG and Karaba forces that
oppose Princess Mineva plan to invade Dakar!

00:03:00.390 --> 00:03:02.960
You mean that ship that
looks like White Base?

00:03:02.960 --> 00:03:09.380
Yes. There are rumors that its mobile suit team
is sneaking into Dakar through the desert.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:11.000
Gundams, huh?

00:03:11.370 --> 00:03:13.280
It's been eight years.

00:03:15.430 --> 00:03:17.020
Yes, sir.

00:03:18.490 --> 00:03:20.510
Our day has arrived.

00:03:21.910 --> 00:03:23.140
The time has come!

00:03:23.140 --> 00:03:27.320
We will crush those who defy the Zabi family,
then hasten to Princess Mineva's side!

00:03:27.320 --> 00:03:30.240
And we shall begin by
defeating those Gundams!

00:03:30.240 --> 00:03:32.220
Gather the entire Rommel corps!

00:03:32.220 --> 00:03:33.700
Yes, sir!

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:37.220
Sieg Zeon!

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:39.960
Yes. Sieg Zeon!

00:03:52.390 --> 00:03:54.240
Sieg Zeon!

00:03:54.240 --> 00:03:56.280
Sieg Zeon!

00:03:56.280 --> 00:03:57.810
Good work.

00:03:58.270 --> 00:03:59.540
Where is Niki?

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:00.800
Niki? Um...

00:04:00.800 --> 00:04:02.240
L-Let go!

00:04:02.240 --> 00:04:03.680
Don't go, darling!

00:04:03.680 --> 00:04:04.380
Dad!

00:04:04.380 --> 00:04:05.730
Darling!

00:04:07.450 --> 00:04:08.640
Commander Rommel!

00:04:08.640 --> 00:04:11.190
Please don't send my husband to war!

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.180
Commander?!

00:04:14.180 --> 00:04:15.320
Dad!

00:04:15.320 --> 00:04:17.980
What did my husband ever do to you?!

00:04:17.980 --> 00:04:22.270
Niki, stand up! There are no
cowards in the Rommel corps!

00:04:22.270 --> 00:04:25.560
It is fine to have a family,
but yours has no discipline!

00:04:25.560 --> 00:04:27.490
Y-Yes, sir!

00:04:27.490 --> 00:04:28.660
Niki!

00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:30.580
Don't embarrass me any further!

00:04:31.430 --> 00:04:33.540
Dad!

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:38.280
The reason we bore all these hardships
in this desert for these past eight years...

00:04:38.280 --> 00:04:41.720
was because we wished for the
revival of the Principality of Zeon!

00:04:41.720 --> 00:04:47.400
Princess Mineva's descent to Earth means
that our prayers finally reached space.

00:04:47.400 --> 00:04:48.840
Now is the time!

00:04:48.840 --> 00:04:52.130
You will rise, Rommel's brave warriors!

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:53.260
Sieg...

00:04:53.260 --> 00:05:00.610
Zeon! Sieg Zeon! Sieg Zeon!
Sieg Zeon! Sieg Zeon!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:06.970
All right!

00:05:17.710 --> 00:05:19.900
Send out the scouts, Ensign Niki!

00:05:19.900 --> 00:05:21.180
Yes, sir!

00:05:22.880 --> 00:05:24.300
Don't get caught!

00:05:24.300 --> 00:05:25.690
Yes, sir!

00:05:26.180 --> 00:05:28.110
Finally, the day has come...

00:05:33.600 --> 00:05:36.640
Hey, don't forget to check the bazookas!

00:05:38.760 --> 00:05:40.580
Commander, I'm on my way!

00:05:40.580 --> 00:05:41.860
Make sure to locate them!

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:43.180
Yes, sir!

00:05:59.680 --> 00:06:01.440
How's it going?

00:06:01.440 --> 00:06:02.800
Take a look.

00:06:02.800 --> 00:06:06.730
D-Dammit! Dammit, open!

00:06:06.990 --> 00:06:09.540
How does so much sand get in there?

00:06:09.540 --> 00:06:12.630
If it's this hard now,
how are we gonna fight?

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:14.650
I don't know anything about sand!

00:06:14.890 --> 00:06:16.880
Ugh, what are we going to do?!

00:06:16.880 --> 00:06:19.070
Come on, get out!

00:06:19.070 --> 00:06:21.440
Hurry up and come out here!

00:06:21.440 --> 00:06:22.960
Hey! Elpeo!

00:06:22.960 --> 00:06:24.370
Be a good girl and come outside!

00:06:24.370 --> 00:06:25.540
Unlock it, please!

00:06:25.540 --> 00:06:29.460
In a place like this, I feel yucky
if I don't take a bath every day!

00:06:29.460 --> 00:06:31.780
Judau, you still can't get in?

00:06:31.780 --> 00:06:33.310
My throat's all parched.

00:06:33.310 --> 00:06:34.870
Wait just a minute more!

00:06:34.870 --> 00:06:37.320
How do you find the
energy to shout, Judau?

00:06:37.320 --> 00:06:39.340
Roux, I'm borrowing the Zeta Gundam!

00:06:39.340 --> 00:06:40.710
Where are you going?

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:43.620
I'll find an oasis and bring some water.

00:06:43.620 --> 00:06:45.080
That way nobody can complain!

00:06:45.080 --> 00:06:47.250
Just use the Double Zeta!

00:06:47.690 --> 00:06:49.740
This one's more maneuverable.

00:06:49.740 --> 00:06:52.720
Well, get us some food, too!

00:06:52.720 --> 00:06:54.440
I want some fresh fruit!

00:06:54.670 --> 00:06:58.760
You can ask for anything you like,
but what am I supposed to find in a desert?

00:07:04.450 --> 00:07:06.920
Looks like we're gonna need
a shower right now!

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:09.320
Elle! I don't care how,
but get Ple outta there!

00:07:09.320 --> 00:07:10.330
You know--

00:07:10.330 --> 00:07:12.340
Who the hell does she
think she is, anyway?

00:07:14.380 --> 00:07:16.800
What? Oh, no!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:21.350
Judau, where are you going?
I'll go with you!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:24.860
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:07:24.860 --> 00:07:28.760
Ple! Hold it! Stop right now! PLE!

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.120
Roux!

00:07:32.470 --> 00:07:34.760
Ouch... Ple!

00:07:37.010 --> 00:07:40.400
Who said we had to bring Ple
with us in the first place?

00:07:45.200 --> 00:07:47.240
What the...?

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:49.070
The Mega Rider?

00:07:59.070 --> 00:08:00.310
Judau!

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:03.590
Don't you realize that I'm doing
all this because of you?!

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:06.290
Get out of the sun!

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:08.790
In a place like this,
I need to take a bath,

00:08:08.790 --> 00:08:11.430
and when I was taking one,
you went off on your own!

00:08:14.440 --> 00:08:16.730
A new AEUG mobile suit...?

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:20.110
And that other machine...
is that a tank?

00:08:36.240 --> 00:08:40.360
It's a Zeta type.
Interesting thing it's riding on.

00:08:40.360 --> 00:08:43.880
It seems to have powerful
hovering functions.

00:08:43.880 --> 00:08:46.520
Perhaps they've modified it
for desert use.

00:08:48.400 --> 00:08:52.190
We can't fight them with insufficient data.
I'd like to know their full strength.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:53.580
Yes, sir!

00:08:56.890 --> 00:08:58.570
Men, proceed as planned!

00:08:58.570 --> 00:09:01.520
Wait for me and Callahan
at the interception point.

00:09:01.520 --> 00:09:02.810
Yes, sir!

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:16.560
Ensign Callahan, I hear Niki sighted the
enemy mobile suits at ground zero?

00:09:16.560 --> 00:09:17.700
Yes, sir.

00:09:21.640 --> 00:09:23.040
Here!

00:09:24.610 --> 00:09:27.800
Elle and the others must be
starving by now.

00:09:27.800 --> 00:09:29.880
Who cares about them?

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:32.720
You know, that's the one
bad thing about you.

00:09:32.720 --> 00:09:33.860
Really?

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:37.180
If you don't work on it,
everybody's gonna hate you.

00:09:37.180 --> 00:09:38.960
That's okay!

00:09:38.960 --> 00:09:41.740
I just want you to like me, Judau!

00:09:41.740 --> 00:09:44.390
Stop that! I'm already too hot!

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:04.910
What?!

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:09.210
Is this all you've got, new model?!

00:10:10.570 --> 00:10:11.760
Judau!

00:10:19.690 --> 00:10:20.630
Judau!

00:10:20.630 --> 00:10:23.400
Hang on, Ple! I'm going in!

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:36.030
Your timing is pathetic!
You have a lot to learn!

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.040
What's with the high
and mighty attitude?!

00:10:46.290 --> 00:10:47.440
He's fast!

00:10:47.440 --> 00:10:49.240
Commander Rommel!

00:10:49.630 --> 00:10:52.660
Get behind him, Callahan!
Don't let the enemy rest!

00:10:55.200 --> 00:10:57.200
Ple, run over to the Mega Rider.

00:10:57.200 --> 00:10:58.150
But--

00:10:58.150 --> 00:11:00.040
I'll go pick you up once
I beat these guys!

00:11:00.040 --> 00:11:01.620
Okay!

00:11:02.190 --> 00:11:03.100
Hurry!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.650
I'm hurrying!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:13.550
You're going after an unarmed girl?!

00:11:20.750 --> 00:11:22.090
Ple, run!

00:11:22.330 --> 00:11:24.020
I know!

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:26.490
Zeta Gundam!

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:28.690
These guys...

00:11:31.350 --> 00:11:33.070
Dammit, my legs!

00:11:35.310 --> 00:11:36.840
I've got you!

00:11:38.730 --> 00:11:40.440
You're pretty good, Zeta!

00:11:42.990 --> 00:11:44.240
Commander!

00:11:45.710 --> 00:11:47.350
Take this!

00:11:58.130 --> 00:12:01.620
Where are they?
Where'd the enemy go...?

00:12:17.060 --> 00:12:18.580
Over there?!

00:12:22.610 --> 00:12:23.950
I'm out of ammo?!

00:12:25.450 --> 00:12:28.950
Callahan! We'll close in and
confuse the enemy. Understood?

00:12:28.950 --> 00:12:30.360
Yes, sir!

00:12:34.350 --> 00:12:35.660
What?!

00:12:39.700 --> 00:12:42.870
I'm not gonna let the likes of
you defeat big brother Judau!

00:12:45.560 --> 00:12:47.080
Judau!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:49.260
Ple!

00:12:49.260 --> 00:12:52.010
A vehicle with a mega particle cannon?

00:12:52.010 --> 00:12:54.790
That machine isn't a Dodai, either.

00:12:54.790 --> 00:12:58.850
But they won't escape while
they're in our territory!

00:13:12.290 --> 00:13:14.150
The sun's reached this far?!

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:16.600
Hey, Mondo, time to
switch watch! Get up!

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:20.680
The cockpit is a sauna.
My throat is parched...

00:13:20.680 --> 00:13:23.160
Why do we have to put up with this crap?

00:13:23.320 --> 00:13:25.590
I don't feel like getting up, either.

00:13:25.590 --> 00:13:27.730
What are you talking about?

00:13:28.210 --> 00:13:29.790
Beecha, let's go!

00:13:29.790 --> 00:13:31.070
Go where?

00:13:31.070 --> 00:13:32.400
We're gonna follow Judau!

00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.710
Who knows what happened to him and Ple.

00:13:34.710 --> 00:13:36.390
I guess that beats just
sitting around here.

00:13:36.560 --> 00:13:41.130
Slower! Mind your balance!

00:13:42.400 --> 00:13:43.920
Ensign Callahan!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:45.760
Preparations on this
side are now complete!

00:13:45.760 --> 00:13:47.600
- All right!
- Yes, sir!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:52.200
Commander Rommel! All we need
to do now is lure in the enemy!

00:13:52.200 --> 00:13:56.420
Time to show the enemy that your footing
is very tricky in the desert, eh?

00:13:56.420 --> 00:13:57.530
Yes, sir.

00:13:57.890 --> 00:14:00.360
Do you think Niki will do a good job?

00:14:00.360 --> 00:14:03.880
Of course! We haven't lived
together for years for nothing!

00:14:03.880 --> 00:14:05.350
Yes, sir!

00:14:20.920 --> 00:14:24.160
Commander Rommel, everyone is now
in their assigned positions.

00:14:24.160 --> 00:14:25.200
All right!

00:14:26.920 --> 00:14:30.040
Now all we have
to do is wait for Niki.

00:14:34.150 --> 00:14:37.300
Hey, Judau, I think we're off course.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:38.430
See, look here.

00:14:38.430 --> 00:14:42.150
You think so? The scenery here
all looks the same to me.

00:14:42.150 --> 00:14:44.080
And we're using the
computer map, right?

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:48.320
Do you really think a desert map made
by spacemen will be any good?

00:14:48.320 --> 00:14:51.550
Spacemen...
you mean us Spacenoids?

00:14:51.550 --> 00:14:53.220
Of course I do.

00:14:53.220 --> 00:14:55.870
I think the sun and a
compass are more reliable.

00:14:55.870 --> 00:14:57.140
You think so?

00:15:01.160 --> 00:15:04.890
Ugh, this new model sucks out here.
It's way too delicate.

00:15:05.080 --> 00:15:08.880
So are the old ones. These mobile suits
were made for space.

00:15:11.400 --> 00:15:14.040
Why do we have to suffer like this?

00:15:14.040 --> 00:15:15.880
Let's start jumping.
We'll cover more ground.

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:17.630
But the enemy might see us.

00:15:17.630 --> 00:15:19.300
There aren't any enemies out here.

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.570
Over there!

00:15:21.000 --> 00:15:22.750
No, that's the Zeta!

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:24.120
Judau's back?!

00:15:24.120 --> 00:15:26.540
There they are.
Beecha and the others.

00:15:26.540 --> 00:15:29.250
Whew, good thing they
were on the move, too!

00:15:32.250 --> 00:15:33.540
And enemies, too!

00:15:33.540 --> 00:15:35.040
Was that guy following Judau?!

00:15:38.680 --> 00:15:41.640
Ple, use the Mega Rider to
join Beecha and the others!

00:15:41.640 --> 00:15:42.680
I'll go after that thing!

00:15:42.680 --> 00:15:44.380
Roger!

00:16:00.700 --> 00:16:04.900
That's right. Follow me.
Follow me further in.

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:12.510
I'm sure that mobile armor type
can go faster than this.

00:16:12.510 --> 00:16:14.120
Why won't it catch up to me?

00:16:14.120 --> 00:16:16.840
Is it buying time to
call in its allies?

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:19.420
Or is it trying to scout our forces?!

00:16:21.970 --> 00:16:27.430
Or... is it following me so
it can be sure to pick me off?

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:30.400
I have to make it to where
Commander Rommel's waiting!

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:37.110
Fire! Someone, open fire!
A Gundam is approaching!

00:16:37.110 --> 00:16:39.150
They're trying to ambush us?

00:16:39.150 --> 00:16:42.360
Right! They're all gonna
pop up out of the sand!

00:16:42.360 --> 00:16:44.280
Judau, you reckless fool!

00:16:46.890 --> 00:16:51.000
Beecha! You're not riding alone,
so watch your balance!

00:16:51.000 --> 00:16:53.610
What are we going to do?

00:16:53.610 --> 00:16:56.390
Prepare for combat... We gotta go in!

00:16:56.390 --> 00:16:59.360
T-The crackers... the crackers...

00:17:03.240 --> 00:17:04.760
Damn you!

00:17:04.760 --> 00:17:07.920
What's taking Roux
and the others so long?!

00:17:07.920 --> 00:17:12.370
Commander, I'm here!
There's one Gundam following me!

00:17:16.730 --> 00:17:19.040
He's here, Commander Rommel!

00:17:19.040 --> 00:17:21.510
Bazooka team... don't screw this up!

00:17:29.600 --> 00:17:32.580
I can't hold out anymore, Commander!
Quick, I need backup!

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:34.020
Fire!

00:17:35.420 --> 00:17:37.170
Commander?!

00:17:40.880 --> 00:17:43.540
Commander! I'm still over here!

00:17:48.010 --> 00:17:50.740
Commander! This Zaku's on your side!

00:17:50.740 --> 00:17:52.440
Step up the barrage!

00:17:54.520 --> 00:17:57.380
COMMANDER!

00:18:02.240 --> 00:18:04.020
The Gundam is overhead!

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:09.960
So it was an ambush after all!
Damn desert rats!

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:22.840
I'm surrounded?!

00:18:24.720 --> 00:18:26.800
An explosion?! Judau!

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.360
I'm cutting through the center.

00:18:28.360 --> 00:18:30.510
Iino, Elle, flank them from either side!

00:18:30.510 --> 00:18:31.980
Roger!

00:18:35.560 --> 00:18:37.500
They got behind me?!

00:18:39.610 --> 00:18:40.760
Judau!

00:18:41.530 --> 00:18:44.280
More enemies! Three Gundam types!

00:18:44.280 --> 00:18:47.500
Bazooka team! Just lure
them into the minefield!

00:18:51.240 --> 00:18:53.540
Beecha, go help the Zeta.

00:18:58.520 --> 00:19:00.810
Elle?! What the hell are you doing?!

00:19:01.800 --> 00:19:04.020
Beecha, go help Elle!

00:19:06.760 --> 00:19:08.820
It's over for you!

00:19:11.800 --> 00:19:14.470
Judau! Use your mobile armor form
to take out the bazooka team!

00:19:14.710 --> 00:19:17.400
Thanks, Iino! I'm going in!

00:19:20.470 --> 00:19:23.740
Damn that transforming mobile suit!
Bazooka team!

00:19:27.520 --> 00:19:30.340
We've broken up their formation!
Let's go, Elle!

00:19:34.770 --> 00:19:37.500
It's no good, Commander!
They're hitting us from above and below!

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.000
Commander! Commander!

00:19:40.000 --> 00:19:43.190
Impossible.... the entire Rommel corps?

00:19:43.190 --> 00:19:45.820
Are these new models so powerful?!

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:50.900
The tide's turned in our favor!
I'm gonna shoot 'em all down!

00:20:06.090 --> 00:20:11.280
I've... I've been training the
Rommel corps all this time.

00:20:11.280 --> 00:20:15.190
Even if they're Gundams,
how could a mere handful of...

00:20:17.750 --> 00:20:22.030
W-What?! The Gundam in front of me....

00:20:22.390 --> 00:20:24.680
A kid?!

00:20:25.330 --> 00:20:30.500
Stop it! The battle's already won.
There's no point in fighting now.

00:20:30.830 --> 00:20:33.180
Against a mere child...

00:20:35.090 --> 00:20:38.430
The Rommel corps...
in eight years...

00:20:38.430 --> 00:20:42.900
In eight years, did the flow
of time pass us by?

00:20:42.900 --> 00:20:45.820
The desert is still the same, and yet...

00:20:45.820 --> 00:20:49.720
And yet, a mere child like this--

00:20:54.070 --> 00:20:55.190
Judau!

00:20:55.190 --> 00:20:55.830
What the?!

00:20:55.830 --> 00:20:57.490
Judau!

00:21:15.640 --> 00:21:19.140
I think... he's all right.

00:21:19.320 --> 00:21:24.460
Y-You... you shouldn't do
reckless stuff like that...

00:21:24.460 --> 00:21:26.400
What's that gonna accomplish?

00:21:30.050 --> 00:21:32.910
Reckless?! You dare call me reckless?

00:21:32.910 --> 00:21:35.540
I chose... to wait.

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:38.450
I planned and prepared!

00:21:38.660 --> 00:21:41.310
And you dare call that reckless?!

00:21:50.720 --> 00:21:52.780
I told you...

00:21:52.780 --> 00:21:56.260
If this isn't reckless,
I don't know what is.

00:21:56.260 --> 00:22:00.520
If you couldn't see this coming
until it happened, that's just...

00:22:46.100 --> 00:22:51.770
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.280 --> 00:22:58.990
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:01.200 --> 00:23:03.490
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:09.790
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.790 --> 00:23:16.880
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.880 --> 00:23:21.300
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.300 --> 00:23:23.680
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.600 --> 00:23:33.900
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.020 --> 00:23:48.320
Just how big is this desert?

00:23:48.320 --> 00:23:52.920
As we struggle to find water,
we meet our next opponent.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:55.360
This isn't a "women can fight,
too!" sort of thing...

00:23:55.360 --> 00:23:57.820
No, this is "I'm fighting
BECAUSE I'm a woman!"

00:23:57.820 --> 00:24:02.220
She was the one who
forced me to see that so sadly.

00:24:02.220 --> 00:24:04.620
The sand is washing
over her red Gelgoog.

00:24:04.620 --> 00:24:07.960
Next time on Gundam ZZ: "Masai's Heart."

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:08.290
Next Time

00:24:05.160 --> 00:24:08.290
MASAI'S HEART

00:24:08.500 --> 00:24:11.180
Rain, please visit this desert!
